stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Candidate: endpoint observed
    Candidate --> Connected: handshake and configured identity checks pass
    Candidate --> Candidate: dial fails or retries
    Connected --> Alive: membership admission
    Alive --> Suspect: probe evidence
    Suspect --> Alive: refutation or fresh evidence
    Suspect --> Failed: suspicion policy expires
    Alive --> Left: voluntary leave
    Failed --> Alive: verified rejoin with newer incarnation
    Left --> Alive: verified rejoin with newer incarnation
